{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["<b>the covenant of her Elohim</b> — For women enter together with men into the covenant of HaShem, that neither a man betray his wife nor she betray with a stranger. Another interpretation: they invoked the Name between them, and if it is removed from them, fire and fire remain."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {0 "The phrase 'נותר אש ואש' (fire and fire remain) is opaque; translated hyper-literally as it appears in the Hebrew, though the meaning is uncertain."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:20:51.696510761Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}